#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/blfs-git/postlfs/editors/gedit.xml:226
#, xml-text
msgid "Installation of Gedit"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/blfs-git/postlfs/editors/gedit.xml:229
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"The first task is to install the needed libraries. Since all the packages "
"have the same build instructions, they can be built in one go using a loop."
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/blfs-git/postlfs/editors/gedit.xml:237
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"All of the packages come with a test suite. If you wish to execute them, "
"either comment out the <command>rm -rf ...</command> below, so that, after "
"all the packages are installed, you can come back to the corresponding "
"directory and run <command>ninja test</command>, or do individual builds, "
"running the tests for each of the packages.  Alternatively, you can "
"uncomment the line <command>#ninja test ...</command>, and at the end, check"
" the test results with:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/blfs-git/postlfs/editors/gedit.xml:246
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>grep -A5 Ok: *test.log</userinput>"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/blfs-git/postlfs/editors/gedit.xml:249
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<application>Libgedit-amtk's</application> test-action-map test is known to "
"fail."
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/blfs-git/postlfs/editors/gedit.xml:254
#, xml-text
msgid "First, start a subshell that will exit on error:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/blfs-git/postlfs/editors/gedit.xml:257
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>bash -e</userinput>"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/blfs-git/postlfs/editors/gedit.xml:260
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"The order of builds is important.  Install <application>Gedit</application> "
"dependencies by running the following commands:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/blfs-git/postlfs/editors/gedit.xml:265
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>for package in \\\n"
"   &am-name;-&am-ver;.tar.bz2            \\\n"
"   &gt-name;-&gt-ver;.tar.bz2 \\\n"
"   &gf-name;-&gf-ver;.tar.bz2            \\\n"
"   &te-name;-&te-ver;.tar.bz2\n"
"do\n"
"  packagedir=${package%.tar*}\n"
"\n"
"  echo \"Building $packagedir\"\n"
"  tar -xf ../$package\n"
"  pushd $packagedir\n"
"    cd build\n"
"\n"
"    meson setup ..            \\\n"
"          --prefix=/usr       \\\n"
"          --buildtype=release \\\n"
"          -D gtk_doc=false\n"
"    ninja\n"
"\n"
"    #ninja test 2>&amp;1 | tee ../../$packagedir-test.log\n"
"\n"
"    as_root ninja install\n"
"  popd\n"
"\n"
"  rm -rf $packagedir\n"
"done</userinput>"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/blfs-git/postlfs/editors/gedit.xml:293
#, xml-text
msgid "Finally, exit the shell that was started earlier:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/blfs-git/postlfs/editors/gedit.xml:296
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>exit</userinput>"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/blfs-git/postlfs/editors/gedit.xml:299
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Now install <application>gedit</application> itself by running the following"
" commands:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/blfs-git/postlfs/editors/gedit.xml:303
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>cd build &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"meson setup ..            \\\n"
"      --prefix=/usr       \\\n"
"      --buildtype=release \\\n"
"      -D gtk_doc=false    &amp;&amp;\n"
"ninja</userinput>"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/blfs-git/postlfs/editors/gedit.xml:312
#, xml-text
msgid "To test the results, run <command>ninja test</command>."
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/blfs-git/postlfs/editors/gedit.xml:316
#, xml-text
msgid "Now as the &root; user:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/blfs-git/postlfs/editors/gedit.xml:319
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>ninja install</userinput>"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/blfs-git/postlfs/editors/gedit.xml:327
#, xml-text
msgid "Command Explanations"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/blfs-git/postlfs/editors/gedit.xml:333
#, xml-text
